<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-5">
      <div class="col-lg-7 prose">
        <h2>When a school physical is required</h2>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>On original entry to school</li>
          <li>In 6th grade</li>
          <li>In 11th grade</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Some schools have approval to use different grades, and every school sets a deadline for when the exam must be done before the school year starts. Check with your school nurse so the physical is not done too early or too late.</p>

        <h2>Which form to use</h2>
        <p>The Pennsylvania Department of Health provides a Physical Examination Form for school physicals. Download it in <a href="{{ links.paSchoolFormEn }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">English (PDF)<span class="visually-hidden">, opens in a new tab</span></a> or <a href="{{ links.paSchoolFormEs }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank" lang="es">Español (PDF)<span class="visually-hidden" lang="en">, Spanish, opens in a new tab</span></a>. If your school gave you its own form, bring that one instead.</p>
        <p>More detail is on the <a href="{{ links.paSchoolPhysicals }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Pennsylvania Department of Health school physicals page<span class="visually-hidden"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a>.</p>

        <h2>Sports physicals</h2>
        <p>School sports usually need a separate PIAA pre-participation form. If your student also needs one, tell us when you call.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-5">
        <aside class="values-card mb-4" aria-labelledby="bring-heading">
          <h2 id="bring-heading" class="h4">What to bring</h2>
          <ul class="check-list mb-0">
            <li>The school physical form</li>
            <li>Immunization records</li>
            <li>Eyeglasses or contacts, if your child wears them</li>
            <li>A list of any medicines your child takes</li>
            <li>A parent or guardian for students under 18</li>
          </ul>
        </aside>
        <aside class="info-panel" aria-labelledby="price-heading">
